meta {
  name: Delete Locale
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.LocaleService/DeleteLocale
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "id": "{{localeId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # Delete Locale

  Soft deletes a locale from the system.

  ## Request
  - `id` (required): The UUID of the locale to delete

  ## Behavior
  - This is a soft delete (sets `deleted_at` timestamp)
  - The default locale cannot be deleted
  - You must set a different locale as default before deleting the current default

  ## Response
  Returns an empty response on success.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {}
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: locale id is required
  - `NOT_FOUND`: locale not found
  - `FAILED_PRECONDITION`: cannot delete the default locale
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to delete locale
}
